WEBVTT

49c33011681c-1
00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:04.542
John Muir immigrated from Scotland to Wisconsin, to the Fountain Lake farm.

49c33011681c-2
00:00:04.907 --> 00:00:15.398
Its farmhouse, made of white pine, was completed in October 1849, and in early November 1849 the rest of his family arrived from Scotland.

